## Scope note / 适用范围说明

The MIT license above covers **source code only**.

The following assets are **NOT** covered by this license and remain the property
of their original authors. They are included solely for personal, non-commercial
evaluation, and must be replaced before any commercial use (including but not
limited to monetized live streaming):

- `assets/webm/**` — character animations
- `assets/memes/**` — meme images
- `assets/fonts/**` — bubble font
- `assets/pic/**` — cursors, notification icons, logo
- `assets/preview/**` — preview GIFs (not distributed in this repository)

See [DISCLAIMER.md](DISCLAIMER.md) for details.

